# What must never reach the image. The static server's extension allowlist is the second
# layer — DEPLOYMENT.md lists the same files under "Files to exclude from the deployed
# bundle" — and neither is relied on alone.

# Secrets first.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Environments and caches: large, machine-specific, and a stale .venv shadowing the image's
# own interpreter is a genuinely confusing failure.
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.egg-info/

# Development tooling that has no business on a web root.
postgame/serve.py
postgame/scratchpad/
postgame/test/

# Planning and review documents. They are in the repository on purpose and on a public
# server by accident.
postgame/BACKEND-PLAN.md
postgame/DEPENDENCIES.md
postgame/DEPLOYMENT.md
postgame/ASVS-V2-CHECKLIST.md
**/README.md

# Tests and CI. Not needed at runtime, and test fixtures are surface.
api/tests/
.github/
.claude/

# Version control.
.git/
.gitignore
